      "text": "## Big Picture: Antitrust Framework"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ANTITRUST.md#004",
      "path": [
        "04-ANTITRUST.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:law:04-antitrust, git-history:law:04-antitrust]",
        "canonical_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
        "concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "current_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
        "id": "maxim:law:antitrust",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "law",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "section": "law",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Antitrust Law",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      ANTITRUST FRAMEWORK                                 │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┤\n│  US ANTITRUST                             │  EU COMPETITION LAW          │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n│  Sherman Act §1: Restraints of trade      │  TFEU Art. 101: Agreements   │\n│  Sherman Act §2: Monopolization           │  TFEU Art. 102: Abuse of     │\n│  Clayton Act §2: Price discrimination     │    dominant position         │\n│  Clayton Act §7: Mergers                  │  Merger Regulation (EUMR)    │\n│  FTC Act §5: Unfair methods               │  DMA (Digital Markets Act)   │\n├───────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                          │\n│  TWO CORE CONCERNS:                                                      │\n│  1. Coordinated behavior: cartels, horizontal restraints (§1/Art.101)   │\n│  2. Unilateral conduct: monopolization, abuse of dominance (§2/Art.102) │\n│                                                                          │\n│  RULE: protect COMPETITION, not individual competitors                   │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
