        "id": "maxim:law:antitrust",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "law",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "section": "law",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Antitrust Law",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n§1 prohibits \"every contract, combination...or conspiracy in restraint of trade\"\n  REQUIRES: agreement between two or more separate entities (can't conspire with yourself)\n  Parent-subsidiary: single enterprise doctrine; no §1 violation possible\n  Intra-corporate conspiracy: generally not §1"
    },
