      "text": "### Horizontal Restraints"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ANTITRUST.md#014",
      "path": [
        "04-ANTITRUST.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:law:04-antitrust, git-history:law:04-antitrust]",
        "canonical_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
        "concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "current_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
        "id": "maxim:law:antitrust",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "law",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "section": "law",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Antitrust Law",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPRICE FIXING:\n  Classic cartel: competitors agree on price → eliminated competition on key parameter\n  Algorithmic pricing coordination: antitrust agencies actively scrutinizing\n  Hub-and-spoke conspiracy: vertical actors (hub) facilitate horizontal coordination (spokes)\n    American Airlines v Sabre: potential algorithmic hub-and-spoke\n    RealPage: DOJ/state AGs sued algorithmic rent price coordination (2023)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ANTITRUST.md#015",
      "path": [
        "04-ANTITRUST.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:law:04-antitrust, git-history:law:04-antitrust]",
        "canonical_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
        "concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "current_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
        "id": "maxim:law:antitrust",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "law",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[antitrust]",
        "section": "law",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Antitrust Law",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MARKET ALLOCATION:\n  Customers, territories, or products divided among competitors\n  Per se illegal even if competitors agree \"not to compete\" for efficiency reasons"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-ANTITRUST.md#016",
      "path": [
        "04-ANTITRUST.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:law:04-antitrust, git-history:law:04-antitrust]",
        "canonical_path": "law/04-ANTITRUST.md",
