        "section": "law",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Antitrust Law",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "INFORMATION EXCHANGE:\n  Not per se illegal; analyzed under rule of reason\n  Competitively sensitive: current pricing, future plans, customer-specific info\n  Safer: historical, aggregate, through third party\n  Trade association price reporting: antitrust risk if can facilitate coordination\n```"
    },
